      "review_summary": "The branch wraps gateway lock payload writing in post-open cleanup that closes/removes on failure and adds a failure-injection Vitest case.\n\nPR surface: Source +8, Tests +23. Total +31 across 2 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. Source inspection shows `fs.open(lockPath, \"wx\")` succeeds before `handle.writeFile`, and current main only closes the handle from the returned release callback; I did not run a mutating test in this read-only review.",
